Third-party content in this repository
======================================

data/skilltree-2026-08-16.html
-----------------------------
A reduced snapshot of a public page on gomagic.org, captured 2026-08-16 and included so that the
skill-tree inventory in docs/METHOD.md and README section 1 reproduces offline without a network
fetch. It is **not** covered by the MIT licence in LICENSE and remains the property of its owners.

Reduced before publication: <script>, <style>, <link>, <svg>, <img> and <noscript> nodes removed,
HTML comments dropped, and the 74 per-node data-nonce values replaced with REDACTED (expired
anonymous-session CSRF tokens that src/parse_tree.py never reads). Page structure, every data-*
attribute the parser uses, and all page text are verbatim; `./src/parse_tree.py --html` on the
reduced file produces output identical to the unreduced capture.

data/ranking-system-2026-09-01.html, data/go-tests-2026-09-01.html
------------------------------------------------------------------
Two further reduced snapshots of public gomagic.org pages, captured 2026-09-01, included so that
