docs/METHOD.md can be checked offline. Reduced the same way as the page above: <script>, <style>,
<link>, <svg>, <img> and <noscript> nodes removed, HTML comments dropped, any nonce attributes
redacted; page structure and all page text are verbatim. Not covered by the MIT licence in
LICENSE; the property of their owners.

Constants reimplemented from Lichess
------------------------------------
The five production clamps in src/glicko2.py, the puzzle-as-competitor framing, and the
theme-based damping described in docs/METHOD.md section 4 are Lichess's design decisions, read
from `lila` and `scalachess` (both AGPL-3.0) and cited there with pinned commit SHAs. This repo
reimplements the *numbers and the approach* in Python; no Lichess code was copied.
